{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Willian's Magical Pass Level 3D is an action-casual 3D platformer. Its novelty lies in offering two unique gameplay modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Brawl Mode&quot;: Players select different characters and then embark on a 3D game world, slaying monsters and avoiding obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dual Control Mode&quot;: Players can control two characters simultaneously, switching between them at any time using the keyboard to coordinate and complete levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level in the game features a variety of monsters and bizarre obstacles, increasing the difficulty. A wide variety of power-ups are also available to help players complete the levels.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950030?t=1758584377","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950030/f4a51a24b906ac50cd7c4cfddd5967e19230b217/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758584377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950030/fbed6149bcf9cb4f432a343bc4c6ecffd84c1f93/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758584377","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950030/fbed6149bcf9cb4f432a343bc4c6ecffd84c1f93/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758584377","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Willian's Magical Pass Level 3D is an action-casual 3D platformer. Its novelty lies in offering two unique gameplay modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Brawl Mode&quot;: Players select different characters a